cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use radchain, please cite it as below."
title: "radchain"
abstract: >-
  An open, end-to-end simulation of how ionising radiation turns into
  correlated errors on a superconducting quantum processor: Geant4 radiation
  transport, G4CMP phonon transport, analytic quasiparticle frequency shift and
  recovery, and Stim/PyMatching decoding of surface-code memory under the burst.
type: software
